WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the God of Waves — Episode 1 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.970
Oh my God!

2
00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:22.380
Thank you for saving his life, O goddess of the island.

3
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:50.100
Are you looking for this, O goddess of the island?

4
00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:01.670
O hero!

5
00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:04.870
Give back my board, you sea witch!

6
00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:20.800
Alright.

7
00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:22.000
My board.

8
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.600
How did you do this?

9
00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.600
Maybe you are immortal, is that not so?

10
00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:30.000
I saved my magic for years for this trick.

11
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.200
I will never match your power, O goddess of the island.

12
00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:36.600
But even you cannot break my spell.

13
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.800
Unless you do something for me.

14
00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:41.800
And that is: you marry my daughter.
